          "summary": "The TV show that carried waacking out of the clubs, and its famous dance line.",
          "description": "Soul Train, the 1970s TV music show, put waacking dancers in front of the whole country. Its Soul Train line — two rows of dancers with a gap down the middle for pairs to dance through — is still recreated at waacking events, and Bagsy teaches travelling \"down the Soul Train line\" as its own skill.",
